Vendored code
-------------
The top-level packages `causal_time_prior/` and `dopfnprior/` are vendored
(a minimal subset) from the authors' own repositories so that this repository
is self-contained. They are authored by Dennis Thumm and released here under
the same Apache-2.0 license.

Third-party dependencies
------------------------
This project depends on, but does not redistribute, the following packages,
which carry their own licenses (installed via pip; see setup.py):
  - pfns (PFN bar-distribution head)          Apache-2.0
  - torch, numpy, scipy, pandas, networkx, matplotlib, pyyaml, wandb, causalchamber
